  "description": "CDN / edge host adapter for ToolUp.Platform (Phase 472). Two vendor-neutral implementations of the edge seams: HttpEdgeCache, an IEdgeCache over any authenticated HTTP purge API (endpoint, auth header and request body supplied as data, credential read per call from ISecretStore); and CallbackUrlSigner, an IDelegatedUrlSigner that hands the deployment's own signing callback what is being granted and returns the CDN-native signed URL it produces. No cloud SDK dependency — BCL HttpClient only.",
